      "start": 361.53999999999996,
      "end": 362.9,
      "text": " 14th or 15th."
    },
    {
      "start": 362.9,
      "end": 363.74,
      "text": " I don't want to brag,"
    },
    {
      "start": 363.74,
      "end": 365.7,
      "text": " but you're gonna need to build up to me."
    },
    {
      "start": 365.7,
      "end": 368.03999999999996,
      "text": " Oh boy."
    },
    {
      "start": 368.03999999999996,
      "end": 370.53999999999996,
      "text": " I do recommend you start with some starters."
    },
    {
      "start": 374.14,
      "end": 375.58,
      "text": " Okay, back to the real thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 375.58,
      "end": 377.38,
      "text": " Given the context in which we met,"
    },
    {
      "start": 377.38,
      "end": 382.06,
      "text": " which is like really heightened honesty and vulnerability,"
    },
    {
      "start": 382.06,
      "end": 385.46,
      "text": " does it make you nervous to have to talk with me in public?"
    },
    {
      "start": 385.46,
      "end": 386.34,
      "text": " No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "start": 386.34,
      "end": 387.21999999999997,
      "text": " Quite at ease."
    },
    {
      "start": 387.21999999999997,
      "end": 388.06,
      "text": " Oh, okay, great."
    },
    {
      "start": 388.06,
      "end": 389.26,
      "text": " We can say men's group, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 389.26,
      "end": 390.09999999999997,
      "text": " I was gonna ask."
    },
    {
      "start": 390.09999999999997,
      "end": 391.62,
      "text": " I say A.A., you're not supposed to, but I say it."
    },
    {
      "start": 391.62,
      "end": 392.46,
      "text": " I said that."
    },
    {
      "start": 392.46,
      "end": 395.02,
      "text": " I went on some New York Times interview"
    },
    {
      "start": 395.02,
      "end": 397.58,
      "text": " and what an amazing thing this experience was for me."
    },
    {
      "start": 397.58,
      "end": 398.62,
      "text": " It was a men's group."
    },
    {
      "start": 398.62,
      "end": 401.09999999999997,
      "text": " It was A.A., it was when I first was getting sober."
    },
    {
      "start": 401.09999999999997,
      "end": 402.53999999999996,
      "text": " I just thought it was just incredible."
    },
    {
      "start": 402.54,
      "end": 405.74,
      "text": " men sharing their experiences, their foibles,"
    },
    {
      "start": 405.74,
      "end": 408.82,
      "text": " their missteps, their wants, their aches,"
    },
    {
      "start": 408.82,
      "end": 410.06,
      "text": " and a lot of humor with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 410.06,
      "end": 412.06,
      "text": " I thought it was really special experience."
    },
    {
      "start": 412.06,
      "end": 413.46000000000004,
      "text": " Coming from the Ozarks where we're like,"
    },
    {
      "start": 413.46000000000004,
      "end": 414.82000000000005,
      "text": " everything's great, yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 414.82000000000005,
      "end": 416.98,
      "text": " And so I do this interview and I say this,"
    },
    {
      "start": 416.98,
      "end": 419.42,
      "text": " and I got admonished by someone of the higher ups"
    },
    {
      "start": 419.42,
      "end": 421.3,
      "text": " saying, it's anonymous."
    },
    {
      "start": 421.3,
      "end": 422.78000000000003,
      "text": " How does that help anyone though?"
    },
    {
      "start": 422.78000000000003,
      "end": 424.24,
      "text": " Not for you, that's what I said."
    },
    {
      "start": 424.24,
      "end": 426.58000000000004,
      "text": " Here's the truth, there was a period of time"
    },
    {
      "start": 426.58000000000004,
      "end": 428.22,
      "text": " where if you were known to be an alcoholic,"
    },
    {
      "start": 428.22,
      "end": 429.62,
      "text": " you would be run under your neighborhood,"
    },
    {
      "start": 429.62,
      "end": 430.62,
      "text": " you couldn't find employment."
    },
    {
      "start": 430.62,
      "end": 431.70000000000005,
      "text": " There was a great reason for it,"
    },
    {
      "start": 431.7,
      "end": 434.02,
      "text": " But even deeper than that is they didn't want"
    },
    {
      "start": 434.02,
      "end": 436.0,
      "text": " alcoholics just showing up at their doorstep."
    },
    {
      "start": 436.0,
      "end": 437.52,
      "text": " No one had a fucking solution"
    },
    {
      "start": 437.52,
      "end": 438.84,
      "text": " and you would be kind of inviting"
    },
    {
      "start": 438.84,
      "end": 440.4,
      "text": " just their town drunks to show up."
    },
    {
      "start": 440.4,
      "end": 442.88,
      "text": " So a lot of reasons, my excuse,"
    },
    {
      "start": 442.88,
      "end": 445.59999999999997,
      "text": " because I say it openly and I've gotten some criticisms,"
    },
    {
      "start": 445.59999999999997,
      "end": 447.8,
      "text": " I've had a couple dozen, maybe more people"
    },
    {
      "start": 447.8,
      "end": 449.28,
      "text": " come up to me in the last seven years"
    },
    {
      "start": 449.28,
      "end": 451.88,
      "text": " and go like, I'm the best man in my brother's wedding"
    },
    {
      "start": 451.88,
      "end": 453.53999999999996,
      "text": " and my family wouldn't talk to me."
    },
    {
      "start": 453.53999999999996,
      "end": 455.44,
      "text": " And I found out about AA from you."
    },
    {
      "start": 455.44,
      "end": 456.76,
      "text": " And I'm like, I'll take that dude"
    },
    {
      "start": 456.76,
      "end": 458.64,
      "text": " over 1,000 fucking haters."
    },
    {
      "start": 458.64,
      "end": 459.88,
      "text": " I've had two of those as well."
    },
    {
      "start": 459.88,
      "end": 462.04,
      "text": " but you go around in a circle, it's kind of spiral"
    },
    {
      "start": 462.04,
      "end": 463.2,
      "text": " because it's really crowded room."
    },
    {
      "start": 463.2,
      "end": 464.48,
      "text": " Dax was usually near the end"
    },
    {
      "start": 464.48,
      "end": 465.48,
      "text": " because he's been there a while."
    },
    {
      "start": 465.48,
      "end": 466.64,
      "text": " He's kind of like a-"
    },
    {
      "start": 466.64,
      "end": 467.48,
      "text": " Elder statesman."
    },
    {
      "start": 467.48,
      "end": 468.92,
      "text": " Elder statesman, thank you."
    },
    {
      "start": 468.92,
      "end": 470.48,
      "text": " And I really respected it."
    },
    {
      "start": 470.48,
      "end": 474.15999999999997,
      "text": " Was really open, honest, was a way to take whatever theme"
    },
    {
      "start": 474.15999999999997,
      "end": 475.56,
      "text": " seemed to go in the evening"
    },
    {
      "start": 475.56,
      "end": 477.28,
      "text": " and then put it in the funniest package."
    },
    {
      "start": 477.28,
      "end": 478.88,
      "text": " And it meant a lot to me, really did."
    },
    {
      "start": 478.88,
      "end": 479.8,
      "text": " Good job, Dax."
    },
    {
      "start": 479.8,
      "end": 480.96,
      "text": " Haven't talked to him since."
    },
    {
      "start": 480.96,
      "end": 481.8,
      "text": " Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "start": 481.8,
      "end": 484.08,
      "text": " He was so impactful that I have not seen him since."
    },
    {
      "start": 484.08,
      "end": 485.4,
      "text": " He used him for what he's worth"
    },
    {
      "start": 485.4,
      "end": 487.32,
      "text": " and then you walk away."
    },
    {
      "start": 487.32,
      "end": 488.15999999999997,
      "text": " That's what we do."
    },
    {
      "start": 488.16,
      "end": 490.88000000000005,
      "text": " send him a couple of the free products every now and then."
    },
    {
      "start": 490.88000000000005,
      "end": 491.78000000000003,
      "text": " Can you tell you about our date?"
    },
    {
      "start": 491.78000000000003,
      "end": 494.52000000000004,
      "text": " He did, but we keep you on the DL a little bit"
    },
    {
      "start": 494.52000000000004,
      "end": 495.48,
      "text": " on this show."
    },
    {
      "start": 495.48,
      "end": 496.32000000000005,
      "text": " Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 496.32000000000005,
      "end": 498.32000000000005,
      "text": " And this is really kind of this fun theme."
    },
    {
      "start": 498.32000000000005,
      "end": 499.6,
      "text": " And I often tell people this,"
    },
    {
      "start": 499.6,
      "end": 500.8,
      "text": " and I wonder if you can relate to this."
    },
    {
      "start": 500.8,
      "end": 502.40000000000003,
      "text": " Surely you've worked with people"
    },
    {
      "start": 502.40000000000003,
      "end": 507.36,
      "text": " where you're holding two things simultaneously about them."
    },
    {
      "start": 507.36,
      "end": 509.68,
      "text": " Like if you were to have worked with Paul Newman,"
    },
    {
      "start": 509.68,
      "end": 511.6,
      "text": " I imagine you have Paul Newman"
    },
    {
      "start": 511.6,
      "end": 513.28,
      "text": " and then you would have a man you know."
    },
    {
      "start": 513.28,
      "end": 516.0400000000001,
      "text": " I think it's okay to keep both those things alive."
    },
    {
      "start": 516.0400000000001,
      "end": 517.2,
      "text": " Yeah, I think that's fair."
    },
    {
      "start": 517.2,
      "end": 519.6,
      "text": " I have a handful of friends, Robert Dunney Jr."
    },
    {
      "start": 519.6,
      "end": 522.9200000000001,
      "text": " I saw him as a kid in Weird Science"
    },
    {
      "start": 522.9200000000001,
      "end": 526.48,
      "text": " and him dumping the fucking malt off the top of the mall."
    },
    {
      "start": 526.48,
      "end": 528.24,
      "text": " He's not even a main player in that movie."
    },
    {
      "start": 528.24,
      "end": 530.0400000000001,
      "text": " We had a rad cardigan on."
    },
    {
      "start": 530.0400000000001,
      "end": 531.48,
      "text": " And like a zootsuit or something."
    },
    {
      "start": 531.48,
      "end": 532.32,
      "text": " Yeah, he was wild."
    },
    {
      "start": 532.32,
      "end": 533.76,
      "text": " And I'm like, that dude's awesome."
    },
    {
      "start": 533.76,
      "end": 536.2,
      "text": " I love that dude, followed him throughout the years,"
    },
    {
      "start": 536.2,
      "end": 537.4000000000001,
      "text": " ultimately became friends with him."
    },
    {
      "start": 537.4000000000001,
      "end": 539.6400000000001,
      "text": " And it's like, yeah, I have Robert the dude I know."
    },
    {
      "start": 539.6400000000001,
      "end": 542.76,
      "text": " And then there's the guy I just was in love with"
    },
    {
      "start": 542.76,
      "end": 544.76,
      "text": " from Chaplin and all these things."
    },
    {
      "start": 544.76,
      "end": 545.76,
      "text": " They don't intersect, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 545.76,
      "end": 547.08,
      "text": " Yeah, they don't intertwine that way."
    },
    {
      "start": 547.08,
      "end": 548.24,
      "text": " Did you have anyone like that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 548.24,
      "end": 549.08,
      "text": " You said it."
    },
    {
      "start": 549.08,
      "end": 551.24,
      "text": " I remember meeting Newman, working with Redford,"
    },
    {
      "start": 551.24,
      "end": 552.36,
      "text": " working with Hackman."
    },
    {
      "start": 552.36,
      "end": 553.2,
      "text": " You know what I have that with?"
    },
    {
      "start": 553.2,
      "end": 554.0400000000001,
      "text": " Sean Penn."
    },
    {
      "start": 554.0400000000001,
      "end": 555.48,
      "text": " Oh, yeah. There you go."
    },
    {
      "start": 555.48,
      "end": 557.12,
      "text": " 89, Sean Penn."
    },
    {
      "start": 557.12,
      "end": 558.48,
      "text": " Oh, fuck, yes."
    },
    {
      "start": 558.48,
      "end": 559.32,
      "text": " He'd be number one."
    },
    {
      "start": 559.32,
      "end": 561.6600000000001,
      "text": " Oh my God, how about racing with the moon?"
    },
    {
      "start": 561.6600000000001,
      "end": 563.6,
      "text": " How about at close range?"
    },
    {
      "start": 563.6,
      "end": 564.64,
      "text": " Oh my God, he was fun."
    },
    {
      "start": 564.64,
      "end": 565.48,
      "text": " You know this one?"
    },
    {
      "start": 565.48,
      "end": 566.32,
      "text": " I haven't seen that one."
    },
    {
      "start": 566.32,
      "end": 567.1600000000001,
      "text": " Rush home."
    },
    {
      "start": 567.1600000000001,
      "end": 568.0,
      "text": " Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "start": 568.0,
      "end": 568.84,
      "text": " What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "start": 568.84,
      "end": 569.6600000000001,
      "text": " He's in it with his brother."
    },
    {
      "start": 569.6600000000001,
      "end": 570.84,
      "text": " Christopher Walken, yeah, Chris."
    },
    {
      "start": 570.84,
      "end": 572.84,
      "text": " And he got fucking huge for it."
    },
    {
      "start": 572.84,
      "end": 573.8000000000001,
      "text": " Remember when you were young, you were like,"
    },
    {
      "start": 573.8000000000001,
      "end": 575.9200000000001,
      "text": " oh shit, Sean Penn's fucking huge."
    },
    {
      "start": 575.9200000000001,
      "end": 576.76,
      "text": " You're a badass."
    },
    {
      "start": 576.76,
      "end": 581.8,
      "text": " But he super stylized the way it shot Jimmy Foley, directed it, but I think younger actors"
    },
    {
      "start": 581.8,
      "end": 585.96,
      "text": " should study it because so much is said without saying it."
    },
    {
      "start": 585.96,
      "end": 590.0,
      "text": " It's such a streamlined script and everything is undercurrent."
    },
    {
      "start": 590.0,
      "end": 591.0,
      "text": " The movie's pretty quiet."
    },
    {
      "start": 591.0,
      "end": 592.0,
      "text": " It's great."
    },
    {
      "start": 592.0,
      "end": 594.84,
      "text": " Okay, we share another one while we're on this road."
    },
    {
      "start": 594.84,
      "end": 595.84,
      "text": " Mickey Rourke."
    },
    {
      "start": 595.84,
      "end": 596.84,
      "text": " We do."
    },
    {
      "start": 596.84,
      "end": 597.84,
      "text": " Whoa."
    },
    {
      "start": 597.84,
      "end": 598.84,
      "text": " Love that Mickey Rourke."
    },
    {
      "start": 598.84,
      "end": 599.84,
      "text": " Where does it start for you?"
    }
  ]
}
